-## Contributing to Scaffold-ETH 2
+- `yarn fund:usdc` refuses to run unless the RPC reports chain id 31337, so it cannot touch a real network. Impersonation only exists on Anvil anyway. Override the RPC with `RPC_URL=...`. If the default holder (Morpho Blue, `0xBBBB…EEFFCb`) ever runs low, set `USDC_WHALE=<another holder>`.
+- Use `yarn fork:base`, not `yarn chain`. A plain chain has no USDC; `yarn deploy` there fails with `UsdcNotFound()`.
+- Restarting the fork wipes all local state: run `yarn deploy` and `yarn fund:usdc` again. Burner keys persist in the browser, but their balances are reset. With MetaMask, clear the account's activity to reset its nonce.
+- The fork starts from the latest Base block each time, so the whale's balance and other chain state can differ between runs.
+- The frontend targets `chains.foundry` (31337) locally and real Base only for the IPFS build (`NEXT_PUBLIC_IPFS_BUILD=true`, see `packages/nextjs/scaffold.config.ts`).
+- Node 25 exposes a broken global `localStorage` that crashes wallet libraries during server rendering. `yarn start` and `yarn next:build` set `NODE_OPTIONS=--no-experimental-webstorage` for this.
 
